h": {"view": "canvas"}, "notes": {"about": {"fill": "blue", "size": 24, "text": "Rowing Pals on 17 Oct 2026, in the app’s own colours, type and spacing (DesignSystem/Tokens.swift). Every screen here is in the app; the coach version (decisions 67–71) is built and waiting on phone tests before it merges. Each screen’s Tweaks switch Dark / Light. Names and numbers are sample data.", "w": 380, "x": 2365, "y": 299}, "boatsAbout": {"fill": "blue", "size": 24, "text": "Boats · in the app (phase CV3, decisions 74, 86–88). Since 18 Oct every boat is drawn on its side like the rower’s Feed — stern left, names under the seats, scrolling when long — and a coach can colour a boat (None, 13 swatches or any colour). The upright boards here (Boats tab, Crew a boat, Saved boats) are superseded by ‘Coach boats on their side · boat colours’ further down. Stroke-rigged, bow-rigged or custom rigging (⇄). A rower on their other side gets a ‘Usually stroke side’ note.", "w": 380, "x": 2838, "y": 15292}, "calAbout": {"fill": "blue", "size": 24, "text": "Calendars · in the app (phase CV2, 16 Oct 2026). Rowers’ bar: Feed, Rankings, Calendar, Profile + Log. A week ahead, rowers say which sessions they can make (each session on its own; no Whole day, 17 Oct) and which races. Coaches’ Calendar replaces Practices: tap a day to take a register or add a practice, land or water session, race or event; Who’s available feeds crewing. Boats can be saved and reused. The club’s week starts on Monday or Sunday (Settings, coaches).", "w": 380, "x": 2365, "y": 19628}, "coach0": {"kind": "title1", "maxW": 3231, "text": "Coach app · joining, setup, Profile and +", "w": 240, "x": 0, "y": 8968}, "coach1": {"kind": "title1", "maxW": 2285, "text": "Coach app · rowers and squads", "w": 240, "x": 0, "y": 10576}, "coach2": {"kind": "title1", "maxW": 2285, "text": "Coach app · set workouts", "w": 240, "x": 0, "y": 13204}, "coach3": {"kind": "title1", "maxW": 2285, "text": "Coach app · Calendar and attendance", "w": 